# "Exile all creatures" targets nothing, so hexproof does not matter: Bot2's Sylvan Caryatid (hexproof) is exiled with Bot1's two
# Spirit tokens. A token that is exiled is exiled (it ceases to exist afterwards, CR 111.7), so it counts: X is 3, and the new Jace token
# has 3 loyalty counters. Only the Caryatid is left in exile as a card.

